<p>Note:</p>
<p>I received a lot of great feedback from the discussions at <a href="https://typo.social/@gdc/112959308500800771">Mastodon</a> and <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=41245159">Hacker News</a>, so I've updated the post with some improvements to the font! I've also added some further examples and acknowledgements at the end.</p>
