<h2 id="potential-future">Potential future</h2>
<p>Many people suggested that this concept could be taken one step further with <a href="https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzz-wasm-examples">harfbuzz-wasm</a>. With harfbuzz-wasm a real parser could be used instead of my crazy opentype lookups. Essentially all the cons could be eliminated... Any harfbuzz-wasm experts who wants to take this on? ;)</p>
